        "position": 4,
        "title": "This little product is a Must Have Item!",
        "text": "I live in a remote rural mountain area next to a lake so using other products to protect from ticks doesn't always guarantee that you won't find one on yourself or a pet. This gadget works great, it easily removes those ticks that have attached to you and it works quickly/painlessly. I am so glad I ordered the multi-pak so I can have one on all my keychains & back-waist packs (work & personal). I have been using it more on my dogs after walks in the forests surrounding my property. It really gets all parts of the tick removed, I always look with a magnifying glass to make sure the \"sucking\" part of the head is still attached. If it were left in it could cause a nasty infection. I highly recommend this gadget if you are a hiker/camper or live near a wooded area.",
